  "sandbox_stdout": "Parent: score=1.5068293450, n=768\nPhase 1: Initialization (time left: 1770s)\n  Top 5 inits:\n    parent (n=768): 1.50682935\n    linear1.5 (n=768): 1.97400235\n    edge (n=768): 2.03279897\n    flat_spec (n=768): 2.09129198\n    linear2.0 (n=768): 2.21057911\nPhase 2: Alt-LP on parent (n=768), start=1.50682935, budget=400s\n  Alt-LP result: 1.5068293450\n  Gradient result: 1.5068293450\n  Alt-LP2 result: 1.5068293450\nPhase 3: Coord descent, budget=120s\n  Coord descent: 1.5068263078\nPhase 4: Fine gradient, budget=60s\n  Fine gradient: 1.5068263078\nPhase 5: Multi-start, budget=1255s\n  Multi-start: 1.5068263078\n  Final coord: 1.5068261804\nevaluate_sequence: 1.5068261804\nFINAL: score=1.5068261804, n=768, time=524.4s",
